      </div>
      <div class="problem-card">
        <div class="problem-icon coaching" aria-hidden="true">📋</div>
        <h3>Coaching based on guesswork</h3>
        <p>Team leads listen to 3–5 calls per agent per month and call it quality management. The rest is blind spots. Agents improve slowly; managers manage by intuition, not data.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

