        <div class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">1</div>
        <h3>Connect your recordings</h3>
        <p>Integrate via API, SFTP, or native connector (Genesys, Avaya, Cisco, Amazon Connect). InOro ingests existing recordings and processes new calls automatically — no changes to your telephony setup required.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">2</div>
        <h3>AI analyzes every call</h3>
        <p>Speech-to-Text transcription with agent/client channel separation. NLP detects intent, emotion, objections, and script compliance. Configurable AI scoring based on your criteria — opening, discovery, objection handling, close.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">3</div>
        <h3>Insights in your dashboard</h3>
        <p>Managers see agent rankings, quality trends, and flagged calls. Ask the AI in plain language: "Which agents had pricing objections this week?" — and get answers drawn from thousands of conversations.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

